# Third-party skills vendored into skills/. Edit this file, then run `make update`.
# Format: <owner/repo> <ref> <selector>...
#   path/to/skill        one skill folder ("." when SKILL.md is at the repo root)
#   @path/plugin.json    every skill listed in that manifest (follows upstream additions/removals)
#   exclude:a,b          skip these skills
#   rename:a=b           install skill a as b and rewrite references to it
#   replace:from=to      rewrite literal text in the skill's text files (e.g. plugin-only paths)

blader/humanizer   main  .
# code-review collides with Claude Code's built-in /code-review
mattpocock/skills  main  @.claude-plugin/plugin.json  rename:code-review=mp-code-review
# Only ui-ux-pro-max from this pack. Its commands use ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}, which only
# exists inside the Claude Code plugin; point them at the link install.sh always creates.
nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill  main  .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max  replace:${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max=$HOME/.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max
